who has actively participated in earthquake relief activities in his hometown. He personally rescued his classmates from the rubble. Although he is under the age of 20, he has relevant experience and skills in disaster relief. However, he is not engaged in medical work currently, so he may not be selected based on the given conditions.\n\nOption B: Lao Zhao is a 60-year-old man with more than 30 years of medical work experience. He has rushed to the earthquake-stricken area to engage in medical work many times and is still in good health after retiring at the age of 60. He is also a mountaineering enthusiast and has climbed 4000 meters above sea level. Although he is over the age of 60, he has relevant experience and skills in disaster relief. However, he is not engaged in medical work currently, so he may not be selected based on the given conditions.\n\nOption C: Xiao Li is a 23-year-old who has just graduated from university and currently works in an IT company. Not long ago, his city was affected by the surrounding earthquake. He felt a slight earthquake and once helped evacuate people in office buildings. Although he is under the age of 20, he has relevant experience and skills in disaster relief. He is also in good health and has no experience in rescue techniques in the earthquake area. Therefore, he is most likely to be selected based on the given conditions. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
