messages:   14%|#3        | 82/600 [02:33<01:54,  4.52it/s][['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nIn the past, the import and export of domestic enterprises could only be settled in US dollars or a third-party currency. During the period from the signing of the contract to the completion of the contract, the change of exchange rate will fluctuate the actual earnings of enterprises. Now the bank has launched RMB settlement business. Since RMB is the local currency of domestic enterprises, the contract pricing is consistent with the main currency of enterprise operation, Before signing the contract, domestic enterprises can effectively understand the transaction cost and income, so as to prevent the exchange rate risk.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the followings is true and is the best prerequisite for the above argument??\n# Options:\nA) With the rmb settlement business of cross-border trade, more and more enterprises will carry out foreign trade\nB) When developing trade with domestic enterprises, overseas enterprises are willing to use rmb as the settlement currency because the value of rmb remains stable\nC) With the rmb settlement business of cross-border trade, domestic enterprises can more easily carry out cross-border trade all over the world\nD) Due to the huge domestic market space, more and more overseas enterprises are willing to carry out trade with domestic enterprises. I think the correct option is: C\n', '<think>.\nTo determine the best prerequisite for the given argument, we need to analyze each option and see how it relates to the context provided. The context discusses the benefits of RMB settlement business for domestic enterprises, such as preventing exchange rate risk and allowing them to better understand transaction costs and income. .\n\nOption A suggests that with the RMB settlement business, more and more enterprises will carry out foreign trade. This option is related to the context because it implies that the RMB settlement business will increase the number of foreign trade transactions, which could lead to more opportunities for domestic enterprises to engage in cross-border trade. However, this option does not directly address the exchange rate risk or the ability to better understand transaction costs and income. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
