ade the Chinese vernacular known to the world, but it doesn't imply that the vernacular itself is world. So, this option is not necessarily correct.\n\nD) Only the world is national - This option suggests that only the world is national. However, the context doesn't provide any information about the relationship between national and world in this context. So, this option is not necessarily correct. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
