ocedures.\n\nC) According to relevant national and regulations of law, Li signs a house sales contract in a sales department.\n- This option involves Li signing a house sales contract based on relevant national and regulations of law. While this is related to the application of the law, it does not involve the judiciary organs applying the law in accordance with statutory powers and procedures.\n\nD) The public security bureau director convenes the working meeting for improving the quality of police handling cases. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
