messages:   45%|####4     | 269/600 [07:46<01:55,  2.86it/s][["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe phenomenon of cashless society has attracted people's attention, mainly due to the rapid development of mobile payment in recent years, covering people's clothing, food, housing and transportation, spreading to the corners of cities and towns, and making some people change the habit of using cash. Actively promoting the construction of a cashless society is of far-reaching significance: first, it will help to lower the threshold of financial services and better promote economic development; second, it will help to reduce and reduce the utilization rate and management costs of cash, and reduce the cost of issuing money. It will also accelerate the flow of funds. Third, it helps to establish an integrity system, identify, prevent and crack down on all kinds of illegal and criminal acts related to cash transactions, bribery and bribery, and effectively curb corruption.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, with regard to a cashless society, which of the following is not mentioned?\n# Options:\nA) Benefits for the financial industry\nB) The reason why it has attracted a lot of attention\nC) Relationship with currency issuance\nD) The impact on interpersonal relationships. I think the correct option is: C\n", "<think>.\nTo determine which option is not mentioned in the context provided, let's analyze each option step by step:.\n\nA) Benefits for the financial industry: The context mentions that actively promoting the construction of a cashless society will help to lower the threshold of financial services and better promote economic development. This implies that there are benefits for the financial industry.\n\nB) The reason why it has attracted a lot of attention: The context states that the phenomenon of cashless society has attracted people's attention, mainly due to the rapid development of mobile payment in recent years. This indicates that the reason for its attention is mentioned.\n\nC) Relationship with currency issuance: The context discusses how actively promoting the construction of a cashless society will help to reduce and reduce the utilization rate and management costs of cash, and accelerate the flow of funds. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
