y of most civil trials exceeds the comprehension of the jury.\n- This option aligns with the context, which states that more complicated civil trials often exceed the comprehension of the jury. Therefore, this option is correct.\n\nD) Some countries with the same legal system other than country A have also made similar proposals for a long time, and have records of their implementation.\n- This option is not directly related to the context or the question. It is unclear whether other countries with the same legal system have made similar proposals and implemented them. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
