t. This implies that they may be keen to cover a wide range of topics, but they do not require a good explanation for their knowledge. This option seems plausible.\n\nD) Occupy a large number of scarce information resources - The context does not mention anything about Pancake people occupying a large number of scarce information resources. This option seems unrelated to the given context. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
