d buildings were rescued within two hours of the building's collapse. This information does not directly support the claim that the device will improve emergency teams' ability to locate trapped individuals quickly.\n\nC) This option mentions that extensive training is required in order to operate the device effectively. While this is true, it does not directly support the claim that the device will improve emergency teams' ability to locate trapped individuals quickly. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
