ucive to promoting social progress.\n- This statement does not fit the context as it contradicts the information provided about the generous benefits and sick pay in Sweden.\n\nC) The welfare system has become a heavy burden on the governments of some European countries.\n- This statement fits the context as it suggests that the welfare system in Sweden, which is a high-welfare country, may have become a heavy burden on the governments of some European countries.\n\nD) The pursuit of fairness will affect social development to some extent. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
