ons) that implement enterprise income tax is 28.6%, while the average tax rate of 18 countries (regions) around China is 26.7%. The passage concludes by stating that the new tax rate is moderately low internationally, which is conducive to improving the competitiveness of enterprises and attracting foreign investment. Based on this information, the main content of the passage is the proposed tax rate of 25% and its implications for domestic enterprises and the international community.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
