e context mentions that Scolari was relieved after defeating the Belgian team, indicating that the match against Belgium was indeed tough. This inference can be made based on the given information.\n\nD) England must beat Denmark before playing against Brazil.\n- The context states that England will face Brazil in the next game, implying that England must beat Denmark before playing against Brazil. This inference can be made based on the given information.\n\nBased on the analysis, the option that cannot be inferred from the given context is:. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
