sed based on the taste of the fish at the diggin's diner, without considering the possibility that the diner's food may be delicious. Both arguments rely on the assumption that the critical reviews or the taste of the fish are accurate, without considering the possibility of bias or error.\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
