g or preparation.\n\nOption D: A company filed a bankruptcy application to the court due to heavy debts and unable to pay off its due debts. This action may be related to crisis management planning, as the company may have taken steps to prevent bankruptcy by seeking financial assistance or restructuring its debt.\n\nBased on the analysis, option C does not belong to crisis management planning, as it does not demonstrate proactive steps to prevent or mitigate potential harm.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
