eas.\nThis option describes a situation where human activities (fossil fuel use) have caused environmental effects (higher temperature). Therefore, this is an environmental effect.\n\nD) A coastal city reclaimed the sea to build an island, and a small town with a capacity of 70,000 people was built on the island.\nThis option describes a situation where human activities (reclamation of sea) have caused environmental effects (new town). However, it does not mention any specific environmental effects caused by the reclamation process. Therefore, this is not an environmental effect. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
